        "member":  "richard@capilingua.com",
        "member_name":  "Ric",
        "answer":  "\u003cp\u003eHello Taryn,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks for getting in touch. You’re right, it is a little more time-consuming but hopefully it’ll be worth it in the end. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo answer your question, yes, our house is next to both a great elementary school and a reliable bus route. There is also a large public park and swimming pool a 5-minute walk away.  For the price we are open to negotiation but only for the right buyer. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWould you be able to come and visit with your sister over the weekend? \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll the best,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eR.WEBBER\u003c/p\u003e",
        "status":  "Not Graded",
        "question":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDirections:\u003c/strong\u003e Respond to the email as if you are trying to sell your house privately. Answer the questions and provide at least TWO details about the neighbourhood and ONE reason why you can or can\u0027t negotiate the price.\u003c/p\u003e",
        "doctype":  "LMS Assignment Submission"
    },
